<p>Sends a telepathic attack, trying to destroy the brains of any target in the beam, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">184, 248, 298, 340, 377</acronym> mind damage.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Mindpower.</p>